<title>USA: Corporate Vision gets $350,000 contract.</title>
<headline>Corporate Vision gets $350,000 contract.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporate Vision Inc said Monday it signed a $350,000 contract to produce an interactive CD-ROM, marketing and training videos, magazine ads and printed materials for Central Plastics Co.</p>
<p>Central Plastics is the first client to use Corporate Vision's full range of services since Corporate Vision's merger with T.L. Phipps &amp; Co, it said.</p>
<p>	     -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
